 125  8092 CD 59 BE         CALL TryRespawnMonsters     ; Rellenar slots monster vacios (siempre 3)
 126  8095 CD 62 C6         CALL UpdateDeathTimer       ; Tick contador 10s + spawn la muerte si toca
 127  8098 CD AE C2         CALL CheckPlayerEnemyCollision ; Colision player vs enemigos
