1268+ 97DA E6 F8            AND $F8
1269+ 97DC F6 06            OR 6
1270+ 97DE 32 8F 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
1271+ 97E1 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
1272+ 97E4 ED 79            OUT (C), A
1273+ 97E6 11 ED C9         LD DE, FlowField
1274+ 97E9 0E 00            LD C, 0                                 ; cy
1275+ 97EB              .bzclRow:
