4778+ BCBF 28 20            JR Z, .kamSkip
4779+ BCC1 FE 04            CP STATE_SPAWNING
4780+ BCC3 28 1C            JR Z, .kamSkip
4781+ BCC5 DD 36 02 03      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_DYING
4782+ BCC9 DD 36 08 40      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), SPRID_PUFF
4783+ BCCD DD 36 00 40      LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), SPRID_PUFF
4784+ BCD1 DD 36 09 02      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), ANIM_DELAY_PUFF
4785+ BCD5 DD 36 06 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAX), 0
4786+ BCD9 DD 36 07 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAY), 0
4787+ BCDD DD 36 05 47      LD (IX+ENT_ATTR), WHITE | $40
4788+ BCE1              .kamSkip:
