5264+ BF88 0F               RRCA
5265+ BF89 0F               RRCA
5266+ BF8A 0F               RRCA
5267+ BF8B E6 1F            AND $1F
5268+ BF8D 32 AA 9C         LD (MaiGapTargetCoord), A
