 776+ CDB3                  ; --- Run: count = (A & $7F) + 2 ---
 777+ CDB3              .rleNewRun:
 778+ CDB3 E6 7F            AND $7F
 779+ CDB5 C6 02            ADD A, 2
 780+ CDB7 32 21 CE         LD (.rlePending), A
 781+ CDBA DD 7E 00         LD A, (IX+0)
 782+ CDBD DD 23            INC IX
 783+ CDBF 32 22 CE         LD (.rleValue), A
 784+ CDC2 18 BD            JR .rleRunEmit
