1041+ CEDB 29               ADD HL, HL
1042+ CEDC 29               ADD HL, HL
1043+ CEDD 29               ADD HL, HL
1044+ CEDE 29               ADD HL, HL                          ; HL = charY * 32
1045+ CEDF 7B               LD A, E
1046+ CEE0 0F               RRCA
1047+ CEE1 0F               RRCA
1048+ CEE2 0F               RRCA
