1090+ CF0F                  ; Si solapa con algun pickup activo, set PickupAttrsDirty=1 para que
1091+ CF0F                  ; RefreshPickupAttrs (post-ProcessEnemies) repinte. Sin overlap = no-op.
1092+ CF0F 3A 61 82         LD A, (NumPickupsCached)
