1127+ CF3B 28 02            JR Z, .roaAabbHit
1128+ CF3D 30 06            JR NC, .roaAabbNext3
1129+ CF3F              .roaAabbHit:
1130+ CF3F 3E 01            LD A, 1
1131+ CF41 32 60 82         LD (PickupAttrsDirty), A
1132+ CF44 C9               RET                                 ; flag set, no need to check more
1133+ CF45              .roaAabbNext3:
1134+ CF45 23               INC HL                              ; advance to next entry's pX
1135+ CF46 10 D0            DJNZ .roaAabbLoop
1136+ CF48 C9               RET
1137+ CF49              .roaAabbNext2:
