 615+ EB3F 23               INC HL
 616+ EB40 1A               LD A, (DE)
 617+ EB41 77               LD (HL), A
 618+ EB42 13               INC DE
 619+ EB43 2B               DEC HL
 620+ EB44 24               INC H
 621+ EB45 10 F5            DJNZ .dcsRow1
 622+ EB47 C9               RET
