1118+ ED5D 32 3B 82         LD (ChurchCutscenePhase), A
1119+ ED60 AF               XOR A
1120+ ED61 32 9D 5F         LD (ChurchCutsceneFrame), A             ; reset para SMOKE
1121+ ED64 C9               RET
