1151+ ED8B CD 54 F0         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; draw smoke[1]
1152+ ED8E 18 1E            JR .ucsSmokeIncFrame
1153+ ED90              .ucsSmokeStep2:
1154+ ED90 3E 01            LD A, 1
1155+ ED92 CD 54 F0         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; erase smoke[1]
1156+ ED95 3E 02            LD A, 2
1157+ ED97 CD 54 F0         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; draw smoke[2]
1158+ ED9A 18 12            JR .ucsSmokeIncFrame
1159+ ED9C              .ucsSmokeEnd:
1160+ ED9C 3E 02            LD A, 2
1161+ ED9E CD 54 F0         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; erase smoke[2]
