2102+ F22C              ; RespawnChurchKeyAtAlt - patch PickupTable entry de church_key con coords AltN
2103+ F22C              ; ==============================================================================
2104+ F22C              ; Lee ChurchKeyAltSpawnIdx (1 o 2) y patchea con CHURCH_KEY_ALT[1|2]_* coords.
