 934+ F8A2 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnFingerPulse:     RET
 935+ F8A3 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnFingerOut:       RET
 936+ F8A4 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnArmOut:          RET
 937+ F8A5 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnPlayerTurn:      RET
 938+ F8A6 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnPlayerFramed:    RET
 939+ F8A7 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnPlayerExit:      RET
 940+ F8A8 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnTheEnd:          RET
 941+ F8A9 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnCredits:         RET
